@startuml

title The states of a feed

hide empty description

state "stopped" as stopped
state "starting" as starting
state "running" as running

[*] --> stopped : the service starts

stopped --> starting : Start by a permitted operator\nor the restore of an enabled auto_start feed

starting --> running : the run token is held, the series is free\nand the feed is built
starting --> stopped : the grant is missing or lapsed, the vintage\nis missing, or another feed holds the series

running --> stopped : Stop by a permitted operator\nor the service stops
running --> running : a tick is published

note right of starting
    The reason for a refusal is returned to the operator,
    or logged when the restore started the feed.
end note

note bottom of running
    A running feed publishes under the service's identity.
    The run token is used only while starting.
    The running set is not stored; auto_start restores it.
end note

@enduml
